  "document": "Piola (Milan Metro)\nPiola is a station on Line 2 of the Milan Metro. The station is located on the corner between Via Giovanni Pacini and Via Antonio Bazzini, just east of the Piazzale Gabrio Piola. The station serves Lambrate neighborhood and the district called \"Città Studi\" (study city), a big urban university area comprising Politecnico di Milano and the Milan University campuses."
